If you have a pickaxe, here's how to keep your pet if you want to dig
down to the next level instead of finding the stairs:

1) Dig into the wall two squares so that you have a 2-square deep
corridor.
2) Go to the end of your corridor and wait for your pet to stand at
the first square of the corridor.
3) Move forward so that you displace your pet to the end of the
corridor.
4) Dig down.

You and your pet will fall happily together.




